<title>USA: TABLE-Asarco Inc Q2 net off on special items.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Asarco Inc Q2 net off on special items.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.21		    $1.70</p>
<p> Net			 51,900		   72,400</p>
<p> Revs		     741,000		  682,500</p>
<p>		     First Half</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.15		    $2.53</p>
