<p> Revs		   1,456,600		1,416,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  42,900		   42,700</p>
<p>(All Data Omits 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1997 net includes after-tax gain $13.4 million, or $0.31/shr, on sale of Grupo Mexico SA stock.</p>
<p>1996 net includes after-tax gain of $39.0 million, or $0.92/shr, on sale of remaining M.I.M. Holdings Ltd stake. Half also includes $7.2 million gain on sale of interest in a mining property.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
